[BEGIN]
  ObjTp=Hd
  Cmn1=- VERSION HISTORY ----------------------------------------------
  Cmn2=--------------------\\\\v1.0  10/20/2026  RGW / AI\\- HIGHLY EXPERIMENTAL||1
  Cmn3=AND COMPLETELY UNTESTED. Not run on a processor. Not tried against||1
  Cmn4=a live Teams webhook.\\- 4-Series room help alert. Posts JSON to||1
  Cmn5=a Teams Workflow and polls a reply webhook.\\- Clear_After_Hours||1
  Cmn6=is a count of hours (unitDecimal). A unitTime of several hours\\
  Cmn7=||2does not fit in a SIMPL+ INTEGER. Business_Hours_Only counts only||1
  Cmn8=open weekday\\  hours, and Holiday drops the current day out of||1
  Cmn9=that count.\\- Poll_Interval is unitTime. Poll_Interval_Override||1
  Cmn10=is whole seconds. 0 uses the parameter.\\- Defaults are examples.
  Cmn11=||1Replace the URLs and the secret before a room goes live.\\- Eight||1
  Cmn12=preset issues, Issue_Press_1 through Issue_Press_8. The example||1
  Cmn13=page shows four.\\- F1 opens Teams Room Help v1.0.html when that||1
  Cmn14=file is beside this symbol.\\- //#CATEGORY "0" stays commented until||1
  Cmn15=this symbol is inside a user module.
[END]
